sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant V as Venue (D2C RFQ)
  participant G as Gateway
  participant J as Journal
  participant Q as Quoting engine
  participant R as Risk engine
  participant H as Hedger
  participant S as Router

  C->>V: RFQ (FIX QuoteRequest)
  V->>G: QuoteRequest
  G->>J: append QuoteRequest frame (templateId 10)
  G->>Q: QuoteRequest on ring buffer
  Q->>R: pre-trade check (size, DV01 headroom)
  R-->>Q: ok
  Q->>Q: mid, skew from inventory, spread
  Q->>G: Quote (templateId 11)
  G->>J: append Quote frame
  G->>V: FIX Quote
  V->>C: dealer quotes
  C->>V: accept dealer quote
  V->>G: QuoteResponse (accept, cover price)
  G->>J: append QuoteResponse frame (templateId 12)
  G->>Q: QuoteResponse
  Q->>R: position update
  R->>H: residual DV01 ladder
  H->>S: hedge order request
  S->>G: NewOrder (templateId 20) to chosen venue
  G->>J: append NewOrder frame
